        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHRONO PORT: HEROES OF ALL TIME<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/83e7bccaa9636739a10e7a83b72c3359.avif?t=1765398339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras_big/83e7bccaa9636739a10e7a83b72c3359.avif?t=1765398339 width=800 height=914 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel through time, unite legendary heroes, and save the world.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brief Overview:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chrono Port: Heroes of All Time</i> is a strategic role-playing game (RPG) where players embark on a journey through time, recruiting legendary heroes from different eras to save the world from an ancient evil. Combining turn-based combat, exploration, and character progression, players use the powerful Chrono-Porter to unite a diverse team of heroes from across time and space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Genre:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based RPG, Hero Collection, Time-Travel Adventure</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Target Platforms:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC, Console, Mobile</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/a4e8a00550956c063c631e5522664e05.avif?t=1765398339\" width=800 height=611 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy playing with his drone dreams of adventure.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/7b100098003674f73c86da1c4ab5f20e.avif?t=1765398339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras_big/7b100098003674f73c86da1c4ab5f20e.avif?t=1765398339 width=800 height=612 /></span><br>He hears a loud noise and runs to the window.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/27da059ea636d2003cd0aef0ee6c474d.avif?t=1765398339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras_big/27da059ea636d2003cd0aef0ee6c474d.avif?t=1765398339 width=800 height=612 /></span><br>Stepping outside, he witnesses a massive monster wreaking havoc on the city.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/3e1b3bb8e4caf773a02686fd65557049.avif?t=1765398339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras_big/3e1b3bb8e4caf773a02686fd65557049.avif?t=1765398339 width=800 height=612 /></span><br>He tries to fight, but an old Master stops him.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/0990c17877bc7131c76ac3b441f8ba1f.avif?t=1765398339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras_big/0990c17877bc7131c76ac3b441f8ba1f.avif?t=1765398339 width=800 height=612 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Master reveals a long-kept secret—the existence of the <strong>Chrono Port</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/c2c488b109e68ac8fb686ae41054f887.avif?t=1765398339\" width=800 height=796 /></span><br>He entrusts the boy with it and tasks him with summoning heroes from across time to save the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HEROES AND VILLAINS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/474f5ec37c824d259e1b01e51cd0ab35.avif?t=1765398339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras_big/474f5ec37c824d259e1b01e51cd0ab35.avif?t=1765398339 width=800 height=491 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and recruit 60 legendary heroes from different time periods and mythologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has unique abilities, attributes, and backstories, offering varied playstyles and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize heroes via skill trees to shape their roles—Tank, Healer, or Mage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip them with powerful items and stat enhancers to increase their combat effectiveness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As heroes level up, allocate skill points to unlock or enhance abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villains:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/e2fbb54965d1497c4cbfd828e9ff4fba.avif?t=1765398339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras_big/e2fbb54965d1497c4cbfd828e9ff4fba.avif?t=1765398339 width=800 height=505 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 30 unique villains, including mythical beasts, warlords, sorcerers, and legendary monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each villain presents tactical challenges requiring strategy and team synergy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world ends with a powerful boss fight featuring special abilities and environmental threats.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE DYNAMICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roles:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/a62ed2dedb283f13da86e5eb0a5b6e97.avif?t=1765398339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras_big/a62ed2dedb283f13da86e5eb0a5b6e97.avif?t=1765398339 width=800 height=490 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each role is color-coded:<br>• Green – Healer<br>• Red – Warrior<br>• Blue – Mage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frequently used heroes earn XP and level up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currencies &amp; Items:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/e2c41b7d337dfdae9b7210bbdb523b97.avif?t=1765398339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras_big/e2c41b7d337dfdae9b7210bbdb523b97.avif?t=1765398339 width=800 height=505 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coins:</strong> Used to purchase consumable items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gems:</strong> Unlock stat-enhancing items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stat Enhancers:</strong> Boost hero stats like attack, defense, and health—crucial for tough encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consumable Items:</strong> Provide temporary boosts or debuffs, often turning the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Depth:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap heroes mid-battle to counter threats or adapt to environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master buffs, debuffs, and stuns to control the flow of combat.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/160209076b24c3896ecae5bc13e0a5fa.avif?t=1765398339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras_big/160209076b24c3896ecae5bc13e0a5fa.avif?t=1765398339 width=800 height=481 /></span><br>Travel through 60 unique worlds using the Chrono-Porter. Each world features distinct environments, enemies, quests, puzzles, and hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 vs 3 Turn-Based Combat:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/25d957accc570ac1f9caad7278e3fe92.avif?t=1765398339\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras_big/25d957accc570ac1f9caad7278e3fe92.avif?t=1765398339 width=800 height=511 /></span>Battle in teams of three heroes. Speed determines turn order. Choose to attack, defend, or swap—every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Customization &amp; Progression:</strong><br>Heroes gain XP from missions and combat. Unlock abilities via skill trees and evolve your team’s strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management:</strong><br>Collect and manage coins and gems wisely. Use them to upgrade heroes, unlock items, and progress through increasingly difficult challenges.</p>",
